      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The dockhand is adjacent to a crate</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The dockhand picks up a crate and heaves it up to 15 feet. Upon landing, the crate breaks open in a 5ft Type:burst. Each creature in the area takes 1d6 Bludgeoning Damage damage with a Basic DC 13 Reflex Saving Throw save, and the area is difficult terrain until cleared.</p>",
